  "notes": "Read all eight requested files. Six additional routes are accounted for: thread GET and PATCH both select by thread ID and caller identity; health and readiness use fixed probe identifiers; the two identity-reporting custom routes return the caller’s own data. ([raw.githubusercontent.com](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aegra/aegra/d7d80c850010a9c5a3d2be59254c19b9eb0e25dd/libs/aegra-api/src/aegra_api/api/threads.py)) RunJob preserves the user separately from execution configuration, but storing that identity does not establish that it is enforced. Next: verify how the local and Redis-backed executors use it before changing persistent state. ([raw.githubusercontent.com](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aegra/aegra/d7d80c850010a9c5a3d2be59254c19b9eb0e25dd/libs/aegra-api/src/aegra_api/models/run_job.py))"
